                <pb facs="0931" n="811" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg811"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-06-18"><hi rendition="#italic">June 18,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have just received the following from Count Lamsdorff:</p>
                <p>“I hasten to inform your excellency that His Majesty the Emperor sees no
                    objection to the choice of Washington as a place of conference for the Russian
                    and Japanese plenipotentiaries.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Meyer.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
